<tr><td>Desk needed</td><td>Any desk with enough knee clearance</td><td>Standing desk or converter</td></tr>
<tr><td>Typical effort</td><td>Light to moderate (about 2.0–2.8 METs)</td><td>Light to moderate walking (about 2.0–3.5 METs, depending on speed)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Steps on a tracker</td><td>Often missed or undercounted</td><td>Counted like normal walking</td></tr>
